ligned}∇\\,f(x,y,z) & ={f}_{x}(x,y,z)\\,i+{f}_{y}(x,y,z)\\,j+{f}_{z}(x,y,z)\\,k \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(6{x}^{2}-y+{z}^{3})\\text{ }i+\\frac{∂}{∂y}(6{x}^{2}-y+{z}^{3})\\text{ }j+\\frac{∂}{∂z}(6{x}^{2}-y+{z}^{3})\\text{ }k \\\\  & =12x\\text{ }i-\\text{ }j+3{z}^{2}k \\\\ ∇\\,f(\\frac{1}{2},3,2) & =12\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\text{ }i-\\text{ }j+3(2)^{2}k \\\\  & =6\\,i-\\,j+12k \\\\  & =⟨6,-1,12⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now write down the Cartesian equation of the tangent plane to the level surface, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})\\cdot ⟨x-{x}_{0},\\,y-{y}_{0},\\,z-{z}_{0}⟩ & =0 \\\\ ∇f(\\frac{1}{2},3,2)\\cdot ⟨x-\\frac{1}{2},\\,y-3,\\,z-2⟩ & =0 \\\\ ⟨6,-1,12⟩\\cdot ⟨x-\\frac{1}{2},\\,y-3,\\,z-2⟩ & =0 \\\\ 6(x-\\frac{1}{2})-(y-3)+12(z-2) & =0 \\\\ 6x-y+12z-24 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362477 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362478 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362477 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362479 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362477 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362480 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362477 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362481 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362477 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362482 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362477 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362477 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362477 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362478 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362477 1080 #uuid "ac4c269d-3ccc-505a-8b3b-1f9e614487fa" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362478 1081 "6x-y+12z-24=0" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362478 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362478 1084 #uuid "193c9497-7ea6-5a1d-b9f5-a009ce93ca23" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362479 1081 "6x-y+z+12=0" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362479 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 tr