get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇\\times F & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ \\frac{∂}{∂x} & \\frac{∂}{∂y} & \\frac{∂}{∂z} \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡z & 0 & xy\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =[\\frac{∂}{∂y}(xy)-\\frac{∂}{∂z}(0)]i-[\\frac{∂}{∂x}(xy)-\\frac{∂}{∂z}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡z)]j+[\\frac{∂}{∂x}(0)-\\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡z)]k \\\\  & =(x-0)i-(y-\\frac{1}{z})j+(0-0)k \\\\  & =x\\,i+(\\frac{1}{z}-y)j.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApplying the linearity properties, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇\\times (F-G) & =∇\\times F-∇\\times G \\\\  & =x\\,i+(\\frac{1}{z}-y)j-[-i+2z\\,j-x\\,k] \\\\  & =x\\,i+(\\frac{1}{z}-y)j+i-2z\\,j+x\\,k \\\\  & =(x+1)\\,i+(\\frac{1}{z}-y-2z)j+x\\,k.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, evaluating at the point $(0,2,1),$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(∇\\times (F-G))(0,2,1) & =(0+1)\\,i+(\\frac{1}{1}-2-2(1))j+0\\,k \\\\  & =i-3\\,j.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362498 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362498 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362498 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362501 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362498 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362502 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362498 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362503 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362498 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362498 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362498 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362498 1080 #uuid "bc4e76b2-9e53-585b-b42d-cd7facc74bf5" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362499 1081 "-3\\,k" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362499 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362499 1084 #uuid "8fd57de8-9613-5a2d-b250-1256e758fcdd" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362500 1081 "i-3\\,j" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362500 1083 #edb/ref 175921