ms on the right-hand side. \n\nTherefore, our complete system of equations is as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}={x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}=-2t{x}_{1}-{e}^{t}{x}_{2}+{t}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\nf(t)=-2t{x}_{1}-{e}^{t}{x}_{2}+{t}^{2}.\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362647 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362648 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362647 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362649 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362647 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362650 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362647 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362651 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362647 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362652 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362647 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362647 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362647 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362649 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362647 1080 #uuid "65c6d626-0dda-5a84-a423-66fbe8f062e0" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362648 1081 "-2{e}^{t}{x}_{1}-{t}^{2}{x}_{2}+t" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362648 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362648 1084 #uuid "fddc41da-f9d6-57f6-be13-9d8badcae004" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362649 1081 "-2t{x}_{1}-{e}^{t}{x}_{2}+{t}^{2}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362649 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362649 1084 #uuid "7cc81303-9528-5c39-94d7-ac6be005f1b8" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362650 1081 "2{e}^{t}{x}_{1}+t{x}_{2}-{t}^{2}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362650 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362650 1084 #uuid "ceb14841-db12-5fec-a9e8-1da4eaf82254" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362651 1081 "-{t}^{2}{x}_{1}+{e}^{t}{x}_{2}+t" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362651 1083 #edb/ref 1759218604