ven below.\n\n| $x$ | $1$ | $3$ | $5$ | $7$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $f(x)$ | $\\frac{1}{8}$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ | $\\frac{1}{2}$ | $\\frac{1}{8}$ |\n\nCalculate $\\text{E}[{X}^{2}].$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362873 1072 #uuid "2c68c663-d77f-5a12-85f4-75aca5eeb431" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362873 1074 "If $X$ is a discrete random variable with probability mass function $f(x)$ and sample space $S,$ the expected value of ${X}^{2}$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]={\\sum }_{x\\in S}{x}^{2}\\cdot f(x).\n$$\n\nSumming up the products of each squared value of $X$ and its associated probability, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[{X}^{2}] & ={\\sum }_{x\\in S}{x}^{2}\\cdot f(x) \\\\  & ={1}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{8}+{3}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}+{5}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}+{7}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{8} \\\\  & =1\\cdot \\frac{1}{8}+9\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}+25\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}+49\\cdot \\frac{1}{8} \\\\  & =21.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362874 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362875 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362874 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362876 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362874 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362877 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362874 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362878 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362874 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362879 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362874 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362874 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362874 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362877 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362874 1080 #uuid "0494f5c6-4107-563c-a585-1687bd2827c2" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362875 1081 "\\frac{21}{8}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362875 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362875 1084 #uuid "fa850acb-3fde-5f4a-bfa9-139a31b031df" 13194139533445 175921