rue] [17592186362908 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362908 1071 "Find the limit  $\\,{lim}_{t\\to 0}f(t),$ if $f(t)=(1-{t}^{2})\\,i+\\frac{1}{t-1}\\,j+\\sqrt{1-t}\\,k.$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362908 1072 #uuid "71e5ce9a-6809-5820-953d-ab6dbf805abb" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362908 1074 "First, recall that\n\n$$\n{lim}_{t\\to 0}f(t)=({lim}_{t\\to 0}(1-{t}^{2}))i+({lim}_{t\\to 0}\\frac{1}{t-1})j+({lim}_{t\\to 0}\\sqrt{t-1})k.\n$$\n\nNow, we find the limits one-by-one.\n\n- For the first component, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{t\\to 0}(1-{t}^{2}) & =1-{0}^{2}=1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- For the second component, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{t\\to 0}\\frac{1}{t-1}=\\frac{1}{0-1}=-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- For the third component, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{t\\to 0}\\sqrt{1-t} & =\\sqrt{1-0}=1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, ${lim}_{t\\to 0}f(t)=i-j+k.$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362909 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362910 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362909 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362911 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362909 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362912 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362909 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362913 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362909 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362914 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362909 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362909 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362909 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362914 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362909 1080 #uuid "6a0b474f-8929-5985-96f0-7dbfbf7de268" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362910 1081 "7\\,i-5\\,j+k" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362910 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362910 1084 #uuid "9213170c-a303-5e2b-b483-6ba8ee4c9fe5" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true]