ct of a non-constant function and a known solution.\n\n- The function $y(x)=\\frac{2}{{e}^{2x}}=2\\cdot {e}^{-2x}$ is a solution of the equation by the superposition principle. In this case, $c=2.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only.\"" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363000 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363001 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363000 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363002 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363000 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363003 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363000 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363004 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363000 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363005 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363000 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363000 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363000 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363002 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363000 1080 #uuid "7e28e57c-d582-5079-8b43-c2947583f2bf" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363001 1081 "II and III only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363001 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363001 1084 #uuid "7eb0a67d-d925-5d22-b428-c6a5e1df2532" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363002 1081 "I and III only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363002 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363002 1084 #uuid "57d49a75-850a-580c-911f-1b7521839673" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363003 1081 "I only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363003 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363003 1084 #uuid "9f341b2f-f73f-57f8-9565-0922cd0dee9d" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363004 1081 "I and II only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363004 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363004 1084 #uuid "f91f2315-a41a-5693-9f45-0