 #edb/ref 17592186363143 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363139 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363144 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363139 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363139 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363139 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363143 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363139 1080 #uuid "b118e46c-6411-5f99-abdf-ecc41ee73bbc" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363140 1081 "20\\pi {\\int }_{0}^{1}{e}^{10t}\\,\\text{d}t" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363140 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363140 1084 #uuid "c28d0505-608b-54b4-9b41-4432c9f6d4b8" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363141 1081 "100\\pi {\\int }_{0}^{1}{e}^{4t}\\sqrt{{e}^{6t}+1}\\,\\text{d}t" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363141 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363141 1084 #uuid "660b58be-797f-55e4-b862-862f1118e66d" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363142 1081 "2\\pi {\\int }_{0}^{1}{e}^{5t}\\sqrt{{e}^{4t}+1}\\,\\text{d}t" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363142 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363142 1084 #uuid "bf5554e6-7c6b-504f-8963-8de0515bfbfb" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363143 1081 "40\\pi {\\int }_{0}^{1}{e}^{7t}\\sqrt{{e}^{6t}+1}\\,\\text{d}t" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363143 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363143 1084 #uuid "b522f653-6291-54f2-ba12-56068ef449b3" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363144 1081 "10\\pi {\\int }_{0}^{1}{e}^{2t}\\sqrt{{e}^{10t}+1}\\,\\text{d}t" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363144 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363144 1084 #uuid "0f3cf73a-1131-5a64-bf88-e092f7057397" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363145 1068 #edb/ref 17592186363146 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363145 1069 "q-139103" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363145 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363145 1071 "A particle $P$ of mass $4\\,\\text{kg}$ is subject to the external forces \n\n$$\n{F}_{1}=⟨2,\\,4{sin}^{3}⁡t⟩,\\,{F}_{2}=⟨8\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t-2,\\,4\\operatorname{sin}⁡t{cos}^{2}⁡t⟩,\n$$\n\nwhere ${F}_{1}$ and ${F}_{2}$ are measured in Newtons and $t>0$ is the time, in seconds. Given that the velocity of $P$ equals $⟨0,\\,-1⟩\\,\\text{m/s}$ when $t=0\\,\\text{s},$ calculate the velocity vector of $P$ at $t=\\frac{\\pi }{2}\\,\\text{s}.$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363145 1072 #uuid "6c400062-b704-53b2-a5d1-f71fc8c9b881" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363145 1074 "Newton's second law states that\n\n$$\nF=ma,\n$$\n\n \nwhere $F$ is the *resultant* force, $m$ is the mass, and $a$ is the acceleration.\n\nThe resultant force $F$ acting on $P$ equals the sum of the forces acting on $P.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F & ={F}_{1}+{F}_{2} \\\\  & =⟨2,\\,4{sin}^{3}⁡t⟩+⟨8\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t-2,\\,4\\operatorname{sin}⁡t{cos}^{2}⁡t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2+8\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t-2,\\,4{sin}^{3}⁡t+4\\operatorname{sin}⁡t{cos}^{2}⁡t)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨8\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t,\\,4\\operatorname{sin}⁡t({sin}^{2}⁡t+{cos}^{2}⁡t)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨8\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t,\\,4\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBy Newton's second law, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a & =\\frac{F}{m} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot ⟨8\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t,\\,4\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo compute the velocity vector $v,$ we need to integrate the acceleration vector:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v & =\\int a\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\int ⟨2\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =⟨\\int 2\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t,\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is a (vector) constant of integration. \n\nWe can solve for $C$ by substituting $v=⟨0,\\,-1⟩\\,\\text{m/s}$ and $t=0\\,\\text{s}$ into the above, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨0,\\,-1⟩ & =⟨-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2\\cdot 0),\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡0⟩+C \\\\ ⟨0,\\,-1⟩ & =⟨-1,\\,-1⟩+C \\\\ C & =⟨1,\\,0⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the velocity of $P$ at time $t$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v & =⟨-\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t,\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+⟨1,\\,0⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t,\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally  the velocity at $t=\\frac{\\pi }{2}$ equals\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(\\frac{\\pi }{2}) & =⟨1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{2}),\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2,\\,0⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363146 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363147 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363146 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363148 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363146 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363149 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363146 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363150 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363146 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363151 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363146 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363146 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363146 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363149 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363146 1080 #uuid "b7670fb6-77b3-5fc1-8438-31c45735ec36" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363147 1081 "⟨3,\\,2⟩" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363147 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363147 1084 #uuid "3f3602d4-7774-5286-bdb0-42626915479b" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363148 1081 "⟨6,\\,4⟩" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [1759218636