s the *resultant* force, $m$ is the mass, and $a$ is the acceleration.\n\nTo compute the acceleration vector, we differentiate the velocity vector:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a & =\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(-12\\operatorname{ln}⁡t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(8\\sqrt{t})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\frac{12}{t},\\,\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{t}}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the resultant force $F$ at time $t$ equals\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F & =ma \\\\  & =2\\cdot ⟨-\\frac{12}{t},\\,\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{t}}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\frac{24}{t},\\,\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{t}}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWhen $t=4\\,\\text{s},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(4) & =⟨-\\frac{24}{4},\\,\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{4}}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-6,\\,4⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, the magnitude of $F(4)$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|F(4)| & =\\sqrt{(-6)^{2}+{(4)}^{2}} \\\\  & ≈7.2\\,\\text{N}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nrounded to one decimal place." 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363174 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363175 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363174 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363176 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363174 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363177 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363174 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363178 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363174 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363179 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363174 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363174 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363174 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363176 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363174 1080 #uuid "e027ae06-9b33-5623-b5e5-cf57aa2df71e" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363175 1081 "6.3\\,\\text{N}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363175 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363175 1084 #uuid "b0a6e979-0ca9-5949-b220-1bb9acf9aee6" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363176 1081 "7.2\\,\\text{N}