13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363264 1072 #uuid "c948087e-b394-5663-8b66-c2d6a56d25e1" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363264 1074 "To solve this integral, we use the by-parts formula, given by\n\n$$\n\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x=uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe need to express $\\int 2x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)\\text{d}x$ as $\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Therefore, we set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=2x\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=2 \\\\ {v}^{′}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)\\, & ⟹\\,v=-\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute the above into the integration by parts formula, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int 2x\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)\\,\\text{d}x & =2x\\cdot (-\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)}{2})-\\int (-\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)}{2})\\cdot 2\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 2x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)\\,\\text{d}x & =-x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)+\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x)+\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)}{2}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363265 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363266 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363265 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363267 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363265 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363268 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363265 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363269 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363265 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363270 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363265 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363265 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363265 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363267 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363265 1080 #uuid "7906d722-793f-554d-8af3-30e86eebaf11" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363266 108