 is one-half of a right vertical cylinder of radius $\\sqrt{5}$ whose axis passes through the point $(0,0)$ in the $xy$-plane, and is\n\n- bounded below by $z=-1,$ and\n\n- bounded above by $z=y+2=r\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta +2.$\n\nAs a result, in cylindrical polar coordinates, our region can be expressed as \n\n$$\nΔ={(r,\\theta ,z)\\,:\\,0\\le r\\le \\sqrt{5},\\,0\\le \\theta \\le \\pi ,\\,-1\\le z\\le r\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta +2}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, using the change of variables formula, we obtain  \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∭}_{R}z({x}^{2}-{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}V & ={∭}_{Δ}z((r\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta )^{2}-(r\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )^{2})r\\,dz\\,dr\\,d\\theta  \\\\  & ={∭}_{Δ}rz({r}^{2}{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta -{r}^{2}{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta )r\\,dz\\,dr\\,d\\theta  \\\\  & ={∭}_{Δ}{r}^{3}z({cos}^{2}⁡\\theta -{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta )dz\\,dr\\,d\\theta  \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{5}}{\\int }_{-1}^{r\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta +2}{r}^{3}z\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta \\,dz\\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363342 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363343 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363342 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363344 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363342 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363345 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363342 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363346 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363342 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363347 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363342 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363342 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363342 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363346 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363342 1080 #uuid "9e8df57e-c904-5c32-8f54-f331ca9fbb46" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363343 1081 "{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{5}}{\\int }_{-1}^{r\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta +2}{r}^{3}z\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta \\,dz\\,\\text{d}r\