 =⟨\\sqrt{4}+{C}_{1},\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4)+{C}_{2}⟩ \\\\ ⟨5,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4)+2⟩ & =⟨2+{C}_{1},\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4)+{C}_{2}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we must have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5 & =2+{C}_{1} \\\\ {C}_{1} & =3,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4)+2 & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4)+{C}_{2} \\\\ {C}_{2} & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the velocity vector is\n\n$$\nv(t)=⟨\\sqrt{t}+3,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(t)+2⟩.\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364062 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364063 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364062 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364062 1077 "field-2" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364062 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364063 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364062 1080 #uuid "30df93bb-2336-5a15-8234-57ee941cbe9b" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364063 1081 "\\operatorname{sin}(t)+2" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364063 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364063 1084 #uuid "fe7ebd40-8661-5ce5-a3b9-5d8b1b2879b1" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364064 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364065 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364064 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364064 1077 "field-1" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364064 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364065 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364064 1080 #uuid "433a6dcf-6b5d-5098-aedd-55737ac2cf70" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364065 1081 "\\sqrt{t}+3" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364065 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364065 1084 #uuid "9f40fe39-8ded-591b-b64e-bd4b98c2de2e" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364066 1068 #edb/ref 17592186364067 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364066 1068 #edb/ref 17592186364069 13194139533