ce both sums now start with $n=0,$ we can combine them as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{n=0}^{\\infty }[(n+1){a}_{n+1}-6{a}_{n}]{x}^{n} & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting each coefficient of $x$ equal to zero, we obtain\n\n$$\n(n+1){a}_{n+1}-6{a}_{n}=0.\n$$\n\nFinally, the recursion formula is\n\n$$\n{a}_{n+1}=\\frac{6{a}_{n}}{n+1},\\,n=0,1,2,….\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364270 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364271 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364270 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364272 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364270 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364273 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364270 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364274 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364270 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364275 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364270 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364270 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364270 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364274 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364270 1080 #uuid "78ed3508-1cab-5b05-8b67-8d52c939252e" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364271 1081 "{a}_{n+1}=\\frac{3{a}_{n}}{n}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364271 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364271 1084 #uuid "08592559-7a5a-58da-8ee9-058b733e2732" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364272 1081 "{a}_{n+1}=-\\frac{3{a}_{n}}{n+1}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364272 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364272 1084 #uuid "88d87bbb-f200-59f9-8adc-74eda46c0a2e" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364273 1081 "{a}_{n+1}=\\frac{{a}_{n}}{6n}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364273 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364273 1084 #uuid "4d4cfa51-47e3-5509-b4f2-8d2423d92f60" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364274 1081 "{a}_{n+1}=\\frac{6{a}