 1069 "q-81021" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364438 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364438 1071 "Compute the eigenvalues of the matrix $A=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{aligned}].$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364438 1072 #uuid "56966849-84c3-5fba-9764-36084bde93e2" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364438 1074 "First, we find the matrix $\\,A-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nA-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}3-\\lambda  & 2 \\\\ -1 & 1-\\lambda \\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we compute the characteristic equation, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}3-\\lambda  & 2 \\\\ -1 & 1-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (3-\\lambda )(1-\\lambda )-2(-1) & =0 \\\\ 3-3\\lambda -\\lambda +{\\lambda }^{2}+2 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2}-4\\lambda +5 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the quadratic formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\lambda  & =\\frac{-b\\pm \\sqrt{{b}^{2}-4ac}}{2a} \\\\  & =\\frac{-(-4)\\pm \\sqrt{(-4)^{2}-4(1)(5)}}{2(1)} \\\\  & =\\frac{4\\pm \\sqrt{-4}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{4\\pm 2\\text{i}}{2} \\\\  & =2\\pm \\text{i}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the eigenvalues are $\\lambda =2\\pm \\text{i}.$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364439 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364440 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364439 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364441 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364439 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364442 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364439 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364443 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364439 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364444 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364439 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364439 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364439 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364443 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364439 1080 #uuid "5342dcd9-fdb8-586c-8474-2875237d76a2" 13194139533445 17