,y,z)$ and evaluate it at $(-1,2,-3):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇\\,f(x,y,z) & ={f}_{x}(x,y,z)\\,i+{f}_{y}(x,y,z)\\,j+{f}_{z}(x,y,z)\\,k \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(z{x}^{4}-x-2{y}^{3})\\text{ }i+\\frac{∂}{∂y}(z{x}^{4}-x-2{y}^{3})\\text{ }j+\\frac{∂}{∂z}(z{x}^{4}-x-2{y}^{3})\\text{ }k \\\\  & =(4{x}^{3}z-1)\\text{ }i-6{y}^{2}\\text{ }j+{x}^{4}\\text{ }k \\\\ ∇\\,f(-1,2,-3) & =(4(-1)^{3}(-3)-1)\\text{ }i-6(2)^{2}\\text{ }j+(-1)^{4}\\text{ }k \\\\  & =11\\,i-24j+k \\\\  & =⟨11,-24,1⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we can now write down the Cartesian equation of the tangent plane to the level surface, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})\\cdot ⟨x-{x}_{0},\\,y-{y}_{0},\\,z-{z}_{0}⟩ & =0 \\\\ ∇f(-1,2,-3)\\cdot ⟨x+1,\\,y-2,\\,z+3⟩ & =0 \\\\ ⟨11,-24,1⟩\\cdot ⟨x+1,\\,y-2,\\,z+3⟩ & =0 \\\\ 11(x+1)-24(y-2)+(z+3) & =0 \\\\ 11x-24y+z+62 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364514 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364515 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364514 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364516 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364514 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364517 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364514 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364518 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364514 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364519 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364514 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364514 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364514 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364515 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364514 1080 #uuid "a4bef21b-f7ad-5f9a-819c-86eb77bec1f5" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364515 1081 "11x-24y+z+62=0" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364515 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364515 1084 #uuid "14878a31-11ea-5c7e-84d0-fd09663b9dec" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364516 1081 "11x-4y-z+62=0" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364516 1